{"speciesId":406,"names":{"fr":"Rozbouton","es":"Budew","en":"Budew","ja":"スボミー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Over the winter, it closes its bud and endures the cold. In spring, the bud opens and releases pollen."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It lives alongside clear ponds. It scatters pollen that induces harsh sneezing and runny noses."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Sensitive to changing temperature, the bud is said to bloom when it feels the sun’s warm touch."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When it feels the sun’s warm touch, it opens its bud to release pollen. It lives alongside clear pools."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"When it feels the sun’s warm touch, it opens its bud to release pollen. It lives alongside clear pools."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il est sensible aux variations de température et on dit qu’il fleurit quand il sent la chaleur du soleil."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Sensitive to changing temperature, the bud is said to bloom when it feels the sun’s warm touch."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est sensible aux variations de température et on dit qu’il fleurit quand il sent la chaleur du soleil."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Sensitive to changing temperature, the bud is said to bloom when it feels the sun’s warm touch."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Sensitive to changing temperatures, the bud blooms when it’s warm, releasing toxic pollen."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Sensitive to changing temperatures, the bud blooms when it’s warm, releasing toxic pollen."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son bourgeon s’ouvre une fois gorgé de soleil et libère du pollen. Il vit près des sources d’eau pure."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive cerca de aguas cristalinas. Su cabello se abre y esparce polen cuando le bañan los rayos del sol."},{"language":