u’il répand est élevé."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Conforme más pura y cristalina sea el agua de su entorno, más venenoso resulta el polen que esparce."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The pollen it releases contains poison. If this Pokémon is raised on clean water, the poison’s toxicity is increased."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"毒を 含んだ 花粉を まく。 きれいな 水で 育てるほど 毒の 成分は 高まる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il est sensible aux variations de température. Quand son bourgeon commence à s’ouvrir, l’arrivée du printemps est imminente."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Es muy sensible a los cambios de temperatura. Anuncia la llegada inminente de la primavera cuando florece."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon is highly sensitive to temperature changes. When its bud starts to open, that means spring is right around the corner."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"気温の 変化に 敏感。 つぼみが 開きはじめたら 春の 訪れは もうすぐだ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"When the sun's light strengthens, the bud atop this Pokémon's head opens. This is a sign to the people that the harsh winter is over, and the season of budding has begun."}],"varieties":[{"id":406,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"poison-sting","learns":[[24,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"pin-missile","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"egg",0]]},{"name":"absorb","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"lev